# 选择 HTTP Client 的 local 环境。先运行 auth.http。
# 将日期改为 Asia/Shanghai 服务端的今天、明天或后天；当天须严格早于场次开始前15分钟。
# 每次新的预约意图使用新 UUID；网络重试必须沿用原 Idempotency-Key。
# 若要演示已确认退款，第一张预约选择 D+2，确保取消时严格超过开诊前24小时。

@appointmentDate = 2026-11-13
@secondAppointmentDate = 2026-11-12
@paidKey = 11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111
@cancelKey = 22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222
@rebookKey = 33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333333

### 创建就诊人
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/patients
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "HTTP 示例就诊人",
  "documentType": "RESIDENT_ID_CARD",
  "documentNo": "11010519491231002X",
  "contactPhone": "13800138000",
  "contactEmail": "patient@example.com"
}

> {% client.global.set("patientId", response.body.data.id); %}

### 查询今天、明天、后天：每天四段，共12项，含截止及可预约状态；查询不生成场次
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/doctors/1/schedules
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 首次下单按需生成场次并暂占库存
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{paidKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "doctorId": "1",
  "appointmentDate": "{{appointmentDate}}",
  "sessionType": "MORNING_FIRST",
  "patientId": "{{patientId}}"
}

> {%
client.global.set("paidAppointmentId", response.body.data.appointmentOrderId);
if (response.status === 201) {
  client.global.set("paidPaymentId", response.body.data.paymentOrderId);
}
// 200幂等重放仅含预约标识；先查详情，再取paymentOrderId。
%}

### 网络重试：同键同内容返回原预约，不重复占号
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{paidKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "doctorId": "1",
  "appointmentDate": "{{appointmentDate}}",
  "sessionType": "MORNING_FIRST",
  "patientId": "{{patientId}}"
}

### 查询最新详情并取支付单ID：首次创建和200幂等重放都从这里继续
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments/{{paidAppointmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

> {% client.global.set("paidPaymentId", response.body.data.paymentOrderId); %}

### 截止前创建 MockPay 支付尝试
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments/{{paidPaymentId}}/attempts
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "channel": "MOCK" }

> {% client.global.set("paidCheckoutUrl", response.body.data.checkoutUrl); %}

### MockPay 完成支付并异步投递回调
POST {{baseUrl}}{{paidCheckoutUrl}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 轮询详情：可能先为 CONFIRMING_APPOINTMENT，最终为 CONFIRMED
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments/{{paidAppointmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 确认后且canCancel=true时取消：返回202表示退款已受理
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments/{{paidAppointmentId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 轮询退款：CANCELLED_REFUNDING最终变为CANCELLED_REFUNDED
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments/{{paidAppointmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 创建另一个待支付预约
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{cancelKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "doctorId": "1",
  "appointmentDate": "{{secondAppointmentDate}}",
  "sessionType": "AFTERNOON_SECOND",
  "patientId": "{{patientId}}"
}

> {% client.global.set("cancelAppointmentId", response.body.data.appointmentOrderId); %}

### 主动取消待支付预约，释放暂占
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments/{{cancelAppointmentId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 使用新幂等键重新预约同一场次
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{rebookKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "doctorId": "1",
  "appointmentDate": "{{secondAppointmentDate}}",
  "sessionType": "AFTERNOON_SECOND",
  "patientId": "{{patientId}}"
}

### 查询我的全部预约与历史快照
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments/my
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

# paymentExpiresAt = min(锁后准入创建时间 + 15分钟, 场次开始时间)，可跨零点。
# 新下单截止后，原订单仍可在自己的支付截止前付款；查询和重试不重算期限。
# 恰好到截止时刻后创建支付尝试返回 409 / PAYMENT_EXPIRED；扫描延迟不延长资格。
